(2829783, 395032, 10702, '<td valign="top">The green colour is great, the reflections are a bit destracting though. I think the crop is a bit tight, specially at the top and bottom.</td>', 'The green colour is great, the reflections are a bit destracting though. I think the crop is a bit tight, specially at the top and bottom.', '2006-09-13 01:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2829807, 395357, 10702, '<td valign="top">The white balance is perhaps a little of, and the ligthting a little to soft for my taste. For example this wall behind the girls is probably supposed to be white (?) but it''s just a bit red and dull gray.<br/> <br/>I like the gap between the glass things (don''t know the english word for it), it draws the attention a bit more to her face.<br/> <br/>I think the focus should have been set to her face rather than the glass things, or to have her even more out of focus would perhaps work also.</td>', 'The white balance is perhaps a little of, and the ligthting a little to soft for my taste. For example this wall behind the girls is probably supposed to be white (?) but it''s just a bit red and dull gray. I like the gap between the glass things (don''t know the english word for it), it draws the attention a bit more to her face. I think the focus should have been set to her face rather than the glass things, or to have her even more out of focus would perhaps work also.', '2006-09-13 01:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2829819, 395126, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple and clean. Technicly well done, except maybie for the the top edges of the glass.<br/> <br/>Could have been more interesting though, or with a better composition.</td>', 'Nice, simple and clean. Technicly well done, except maybie for the the top edges of the glass. Could have been more interesting though, or with a better composition.', '2006-09-13 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
