(2829838, 395406, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute concept. Were you going for the classis explosion in the face look? :) I think as fas as make up goes, could have been more splotchy to look more like powder and soot.<br/> <br/>I also think the photo could use more contrast.</td>', 'Cute concept. Were you going for the classis explosion in the face look? :) I think as fas as make up goes, could have been more splotchy to look more like powder and soot. I also think the photo could use more contrast.', '2006-09-13 01:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
