(2829998, 395322, 15711, '<td valign="top">With so much coloration going on, it''s a tad busy. I love the facial expression though, and the goggles.  I''d like it in sepia or BW maybe even with a hint of grain - to make it look like an old science textbook. Good effort overall.</td>', 'With so much coloration going on, it''s a tad busy. I love the facial expression though, and the goggles.  I''d like it in sepia or BW maybe even with a hint of grain - to make it look like an old science textbook. Good effort overall.', '2006-09-13 01:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
