(2830104, 395011, 53316, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmm, black cherry and vanilla.  You''re lucky I''ve got one in my fridge or I''d have to come after you for making me want it! ;-)<br/> <br/>I like this photo a great deal. I think the lighting is awesome.</td>', 'Mmmmmm, black cherry and vanilla.  You''re lucky I''ve got one in my fridge or I''d have to come after you for making me want it! ;-) I like this photo a great deal. I think the lighting is awesome.', '2006-09-13 02:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830143, 395415, 10702, '<td valign="top">Well, it looks like the photograph was interesting when you shot it, but you have managed to kill it with your post processing. Sorry if I sound a bit harsh, but I simply do not like this effect.</td>', 'Well, it looks like the photograph was interesting when you shot it, but you have managed to kill it with your post processing. Sorry if I sound a bit harsh, but I simply do not like this effect.', '2006-09-13 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830144, 395399, 10702, '<td valign="top">Interesting aprouch, different from everything I have seen so far.<br/> <br/>The background is to white, it draws to much attention to it. Perhaps a white background isn''t the right choice if she''s supposed to be in a classroom ?<br/> <br/>The test might be a little bit brighter though and her face, but that''s perhaps just because of the bright background.<br/> <br/>Her face is also a bit to red, isn''t it ?</td>', 'Interesting aprouch, different from everything I have seen so far. The background is to white, it draws to much attention to it. Perhaps a white background isn''t the right choice if she''s supposed to be in a classroom ? The test might be a little bit brighter though and her face, but that''s perhaps just because of the bright background. Her face is also a bit to red, isn''t it ?', '2006-09-13 02:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830146, 395322, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice props !!! I wish I would have found props like that for this challenge. The yellow thing looks awesome, with the bubble and stuff.<br/> <br/>The composition isn''t really good though. The frame looks busy and lacks a subject, there are too many things that the eyes just jump between. Perhaps you should have somehow made the person stand out a bit more to be the main subject.<br/> <br/>I think the bottom line is that the image is to complicated and busy.</td>', 'Nice props !!! I wish I would have found props like that for this challenge. The yellow thing looks awesome, with the bubble and stuff. The composition isn''t really good though. The frame looks busy and lacks a subject, there are too many things that the eyes just jump between. Perhaps you should have somehow made the person stand out a bit more to be the main subject. I think the bottom line is that the image is to complicated and busy.', '2006-09-13 02:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830147, 393202, 10702, '<td valign="top">Whats with the white corners and small size, not a strong move !<br/> <br/>The idea is good and the colour is also pretty good but you can''t see any details due to the size.</td>', 'Whats with the white corners and small size, not a strong move ! The idea is good and the colour is also pretty good but you can''t see any details due to the size.', '2006-09-13 02:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830148, 395026, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great title !<br/> <br/>The idea is pretty good, but laying it like this on the white background is a bit dull. It''s not the quality of the image that needs improvement, its rather the idea that needs to bee completed.</td>', 'Great title ! The idea is pretty good, but laying it like this on the white background is a bit dull. It''s not the quality of the image that needs improvement, its rather the idea that needs to bee completed.', '2006-09-13 02:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830149, 395397, 10702, '<td valign="top">This looks nice. It goes well with the black background and the crop is perfect. The dark dark red colour looks really nice and in good contrast with the white bubblu area. Well done !<br/> <br/>(what''s with the border though, I think it would be way better if it wasn''t a see through border)</td>', 'This looks nice. It goes well with the black background and the crop is perfect. The dark dark red colour looks really nice and in good contrast with the white bubblu area. Well done ! (what''s with the border though, I think it would be way better if it wasn''t a see through border)', '2006-09-13 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830151, 393131, 10702, '<td valign="top">Chemistry ?<br/> <br/>Well, it looks like you ware drunk when you made this, out of focus and strange :)</td>', 'Chemistry ? Well, it looks like you ware drunk when you made this, out of focus and strange :)', '2006-09-13 02:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830153, 392965, 10702, '<td valign="top">Wel....<br/> <br/>It''s too dark, too red and too boring ...</td>', 'Wel.... It''s too dark, too red and too boring ...', '2006-09-13 02:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
