(2830829, 395203, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, and good contrast with the duotone. One of the best ones in this challenge despite not having a lot to look at, its just a pleasing overall photo.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, and good contrast with the duotone. One of the best ones in this challenge despite not having a lot to look at, its just a pleasing overall photo.', '2006-09-13 09:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
