(2830873, 395406, 36382, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  Maybe the face paint could have been a tinsy bit better.  The hair is spot on. Good 9</td>', 'Very funny.  Maybe the face paint could have been a tinsy bit better.  The hair is spot on. Good 9', '2006-09-13 09:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2830942, 395284, 3102, '<td valign="top">Phew... and I thought we''d manage to get through a challenge without a gratuitous shot of a flower... :P</td>', 'Phew... and I thought we''d manage to get through a challenge without a gratuitous shot of a flower... :P', '2006-09-13 10:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
