(2831062, 395219, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic image which could have been simplified a little in order to make it more outstanding.</td>', 'Nice graphic image which could have been simplified a little in order to make it more outstanding.', '2006-09-13 10:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831074, 394678, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting for the plethora of colours - but a little on the over-cooked side IMO ;-)</td>', 'Interesting for the plethora of colours - but a little on the over-cooked side IMO ;-)', '2006-09-13 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831075, 395311, 51538, '<td valign="top">Test tubes spring to mind - but chemical lists do not, when viewing this challenge details.  Good idea.</td>', 'Test tubes spring to mind - but chemical lists do not, when viewing this challenge details.  Good idea.', '2006-09-13 10:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831078, 395059, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice real equipment.  Perhaps could have been composed a little better to get more bottle into the frame.</td>', 'Nice real equipment.  Perhaps could have been composed a little better to get more bottle into the frame.', '2006-09-13 10:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831082, 395410, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice old fashioned looking lab bottles.  Would have wished for a sharper image in terms of focus.</td>', 'Nice old fashioned looking lab bottles.  Would have wished for a sharper image in terms of focus.', '2006-09-13 10:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831087, 395011, 51538, '<td valign="top">Kitchen chemistry is how we all start out and some of us never get much better.    Not a bad attempt there.</td>', 'Kitchen chemistry is how we all start out and some of us never get much better.    Not a bad attempt there.', '2006-09-13 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831092, 392114, 51538, '<td valign="top">The idea is a bit obscure to me because I cannot figure out what''s going on.  I have a good deal of education in Chemistry, BTW.</td>', 'The idea is a bit obscure to me because I cannot figure out what''s going on.  I have a good deal of education in Chemistry, BTW.', '2006-09-13 10:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831096, 395206, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple graphic image.  Needs a bit more detail in it.</td>', 'Simple graphic image.  Needs a bit more detail in it.', '2006-09-13 10:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831099, 395282, 51538, '<td valign="top">More like physics old son - check your curriculum and go back to school.</td>', 'More like physics old son - check your curriculum and go back to school.', '2006-09-13 10:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831110, 391930, 51538, '<td valign="top">Obsucre when it comes to chemistry, at least to me.  Iron oxide (rust) is a chemical - but the concept is diluted by the landscape.</td>', 'Obsucre when it comes to chemistry, at least to me.  Iron oxide (rust) is a chemical - but the concept is diluted by the landscape.', '2006-09-13 10:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831112, 395379, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple idea and nice flames.</td>', 'Simple idea and nice flames.', '2006-09-13 10:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831116, 395394, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but too contrived when it comes to the makeup and assemblage of props.  Also no smoke and splashes to indicate what had just happened.</td>', 'Nice idea but too contrived when it comes to the makeup and assemblage of props.  Also no smoke and splashes to indicate what had just happened.', '2006-09-13 10:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831119, 395058, 51538, '<td valign="top">There had to be one such interpretation did there not?  So be it.  They look happy anyway.</td>', 'There had to be one such interpretation did there not?  So be it.  They look happy anyway.', '2006-09-13 10:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831125, 395380, 51538, '<td valign="top">The green is a nice colour and the setting quite pleasant.  One of the bottles should be a visual metaphor of an antidote - i.e. a different colour.</td>', 'The green is a nice colour and the setting quite pleasant.  One of the bottles should be a visual metaphor of an antidote - i.e. a different colour.', '2006-09-13 11:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831126, 395292, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the other image with this model better than this one because the hand over the head looks really lame.  This is also a weak subject choice for a chemistry challenge.  In a more subject appropriate challenge I would have given this image a 6 or 7 for the lighting and other technical merits.</td>', 'I like the other image with this model better than this one because the hand over the head looks really lame.  This is also a weak subject choice for a chemistry challenge.  In a more subject appropriate challenge I would have given this image a 6 or 7 for the lighting and other technical merits.', '2006-09-13 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831129, 395282, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is better than the other image with the same model.  Even so, this is a weak subject for this challenge, as it doesn''t relate to chemistry very well.  In a more subject appropriate challenge, I would have given this image a 6 or 7 for the lighting and other technical merits.</td>', 'This image is better than the other image with the same model.  Even so, this is a weak subject for this challenge, as it doesn''t relate to chemistry very well.  In a more subject appropriate challenge, I would have given this image a 6 or 7 for the lighting and other technical merits.', '2006-09-13 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831130, 395413, 51538, '<td valign="top">The old prop of dry ice.  I think the composition needs some work along with the lighting.</td>', 'The old prop of dry ice.  I think the composition needs some work along with the lighting.', '2006-09-13 11:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831131, 395201, 51538, '<td valign="top">An element, a chemical.  But not really chemistry which might show some interesting study of an element.</td>', 'An element, a chemical.  But not really chemistry which might show some interesting study of an element.', '2006-09-13 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831134, 393412, 51538, '<td valign="top">Sort of funny - but not quite?</td>', 'Sort of funny - but not quite?', '2006-09-13 11:02:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2831137, 393797, 51538, '<td valign="top">OK, I accept that.  The overall image suggests applied chemistry.</td>', 'OK, I accept that.  The overall image suggests applied chemistry.', '2006-09-13 11:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831139, 394732, 51538, '<td valign="top">Contrived but visually interesting none-the-less.</td>', 'Contrived but visually interesting none-the-less.', '2006-09-13 11:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831145, 395326, 60899, '<td valign="top">Nice work......only pink and blach would have been better ..8</td>', 'Nice work......only pink and blach would have been better ..8', '2006-09-13 11:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831148, 394433, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yes, yes, yes.  Now how about some chemistry.</td>', 'Yes, yes, yes.  Now how about some chemistry.', '2006-09-13 11:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831150, 392965, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit lacking in detail.</td>', 'It''s a bit lacking in detail.', '2006-09-13 11:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831155, 395234, 51538, '<td valign="top">A classic experiment - looks like balsamic or malt vinegar (which the USA sadly lacks any knowledge of).  I think you should have added a human element too to make this much more dynamic.  As it stands, it is rather passive.</td>', 'A classic experiment - looks like balsamic or malt vinegar (which the USA sadly lacks any knowledge of).  I think you should have added a human element too to make this much more dynamic.  As it stands, it is rather passive.', '2006-09-13 11:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831158, 395316, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds forming there.  I wonder if you had some other shots to choose from?  I like the red beaker and the yellow one - but the other one lacks something.</td>', 'Nice clouds forming there.  I wonder if you had some other shots to choose from?  I like the red beaker and the yellow one - but the other one lacks something.', '2006-09-13 11:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831160, 395249, 51538, '<td valign="top">Water? Polymer?  It''s an interesting texture.</td>', 'Water? Polymer?  It''s an interesting texture.', '2006-09-13 11:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2831163, 395292, 51538, '<td valign="top">Am I seeing two images of the same boy with a lightbulb?  Physics - not chemistry anyway.</td>', 'Am I seeing two images of the same boy with a lightbulb?  Physics - not chemistry anyway.', '2006-09-13 11:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
