(2831624, 395326, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not so.  Hydrophobic molecules do not attract water - they tend to float away from it.  Hydrophilic molecules dissolve and become saturated in water - like the dyes used in your photo.  Nice colours.  Just get the title right. 0/10 for chemical knowledge.  7 out of 10 for a pretty photo.</td>', 'Not so.  Hydrophobic molecules do not attract water - they tend to float away from it.  Hydrophilic molecules dissolve and become saturated in water - like the dyes used in your photo.  Nice colours.  Just get the title right. 0/10 for chemical knowledge.  7 out of 10 for a pretty photo.', '2006-09-13 12:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
