(2832190, 393797, 55956, '<td valign="top">the idea can be good but the focus isn''t in a good side. the main subject is the chain and I think that the focus must be on the chain. An other point of view with other crop is better for this image. even need better details on the chain.</td>', 'the idea can be good but the focus isn''t in a good side. the main subject is the chain and I think that the focus must be on the chain. An other point of view with other crop is better for this image. even need better details on the chain.', '2006-09-13 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
