(2832974, 393733, 16197, '<td valign="top">This has potential to be really funny.  Granted I understand reasoning for the shirt and not labcoats.  But I think maybe dark background with hair lights, Maybe a black plexi under the spill, and lots lots more suds/foam/overflow.  Also think if the kids arms were not folded but reaching for, or flat palmed might give a stronger effect.  Very Fun concept.</td>', 'This has potential to be really funny.  Granted I understand reasoning for the shirt and not labcoats.  But I think maybe dark background with hair lights, Maybe a black plexi under the spill, and lots lots more suds/foam/overflow.  Also think if the kids arms were not folded but reaching for, or flat palmed might give a stronger effect.  Very Fun concept.', '2006-09-13 21:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2832978, 395107, 16197, '<td valign="top">quite the mouthfull for a title as well.  I like the colours they work well.  Just not dramatic enough for me.  Maybe a closer crop, maybe drops of liquad rolling out.</td>', 'quite the mouthfull for a title as well.  I like the colours they work well.  Just not dramatic enough for me.  Maybe a closer crop, maybe drops of liquad rolling out.', '2006-09-13 21:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
