(2835271, 394731, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean, and interesting to look at.  Nice POV you''ve taken in composing this.  Much stronger with the diagonals than it would be with verticals.  I had voted on this earlier (one of my top picks) and I''m coming back around for comments...just noticed the validation.  Hmmm.  Don''t see anything that looks super tricky here.  Oh well...<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, clean, and interesting to look at.  Nice POV you''ve taken in composing this.  Much stronger with the diagonals than it would be with verticals.  I had voted on this earlier (one of my top picks) and I''m coming back around for comments...just noticed the validation.  Hmmm.  Don''t see anything that looks super tricky here.  Oh well... Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-14 16:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
