(2836593, 393620, 35513, '<td valign="top">Composition looks ok to me on this photo, but the lighting perhaps seems a little flat to me.</td>', 'Composition looks ok to me on this photo, but the lighting perhaps seems a little flat to me.', '2006-09-15 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
