(2836603, 395203, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit shot!!!  This one really grabs my eye...good crisp detail too.</td>', 'Very nicely lit shot!!!  This one really grabs my eye...good crisp detail too.', '2006-09-15 00:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
