(2836691, 392493, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I think it would have greater impact if focus on the bubbles were stronger. Maybe a litle edge sharpenig would help, or sharpening with the high pass filter.</td>', 'Great concept. I think it would have greater impact if focus on the bubbles were stronger. Maybe a litle edge sharpenig would help, or sharpening with the high pass filter.', '2006-09-15 00:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
