(2839773, 395322, 42495, '<td valign="top">Appears to have a slight color cast on my monitor, but sharp and color come through well.  The model''s concentration on the flask remind me an actual person in a chem lab.</td>', 'Appears to have a slight color cast on my monitor, but sharp and color come through well.  The model''s concentration on the flask remind me an actual person in a chem lab.', '2006-09-16 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
