(2839780, 395107, 42495, '<td valign="top">Simple chemistry, but you meet the challenge.  Would be nice to see fingers more natural color and a bit of noise removed from background.</td>', 'Simple chemistry, but you meet the challenge.  Would be nice to see fingers more natural color and a bit of noise removed from background.', '2006-09-16 01:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
