(2841251, 395083, 61191, '<td valign="top">Your idea is pretty cool but I''m a bit confused here: where is up, down, left, right? Looks like the blob is floating. And why are there 2 blobs? I would like it better if you''d placed the blob in some environment, showed the creation of him like coming out of some kind of egg or stuff like this. Anyway: the blob rocks :)</td>', 'Your idea is pretty cool but I''m a bit confused here: where is up, down, left, right? Looks like the blob is floating. And why are there 2 blobs? I would like it better if you''d placed the blob in some environment, showed the creation of him like coming out of some kind of egg or stuff like this. Anyway: the blob rocks :)', '2006-09-16 20:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2841252, 394763, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great idea to use black light here. Everything looks so dramatic and toxic! And yes, he has really gone mad if you look at his face! Well done.</td>', 'Great idea to use black light here. Everything looks so dramatic and toxic! And yes, he has really gone mad if you look at his face! Well done.', '2006-09-16 20:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
