(2848114, 395364, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great idea and clever take on the challenge, nice title.  Good lighting and composition, the elements play into each other well.  The only thing I have is that the boy''s eyes are slightly hidden.</td>', 'Great idea and clever take on the challenge, nice title.  Good lighting and composition, the elements play into each other well.  The only thing I have is that the boy''s eyes are slightly hidden.', '2006-09-19 18:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
