(2848175, 395378, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on the category.  Just a touch too much glow effect for my taste, but good job.</td>', 'Nice twist on the category.  Just a touch too much glow effect for my taste, but good job.', '2006-09-19 18:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848179, 395414, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Lighting could have been better - I might have added a key light from the front.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Lighting could have been better - I might have added a key light from the front.', '2006-09-19 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848192, 395126, 42495, '<td valign="top">Lovely blue color and well done.  Only nitpick (and indeed it is just that) is that flask was not on level table and it shows with tilted graduation marks.  You corrected nicely by rotating with the liquid.</td>', 'Lovely blue color and well done.  Only nitpick (and indeed it is just that) is that flask was not on level table and it shows with tilted graduation marks.  You corrected nicely by rotating with the liquid.', '2006-09-19 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848193, 395357, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great idea - I think most can relate to this feeling about chemistry!<br/> <br/>Lighting and composition could have been better.  I would have liked the DOF to capture the student and the vials.</td>', 'Great idea - I think most can relate to this feeling about chemistry! Lighting and composition could have been better.  I would have liked the DOF to capture the student and the vials.', '2006-09-19 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848194, 395219, 65858, '<td valign="top">Looks a little blown out, and I would have liked a better crop - to little around the edges.</td>', 'Looks a little blown out, and I would have liked a better crop - to little around the edges.', '2006-09-19 18:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848195, 395415, 65858, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I don''t care for the graininess.  The composition could have been better.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I don''t care for the graininess.  The composition could have been better.', '2006-09-19 18:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848197, 395299, 42495, '<td valign="top">What makes this a standout is the grayscale and lighting below.  One of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'What makes this a standout is the grayscale and lighting below.  One of the best of the challenge.', '2006-09-19 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848203, 395249, 42495, '<td valign="top">The cyan/blue hues are wonderful.  It would be nice to not have the non-blue spots in middle, but the colors and pattern makes this interesting to look at.</td>', 'The cyan/blue hues are wonderful.  It would be nice to not have the non-blue spots in middle, but the colors and pattern makes this interesting to look at.', '2006-09-19 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848210, 394763, 50034, '<td valign="top">...But he <u>is</u> pretty happy about it!   :)</td>', '...But he is pretty happy about it!   :)', '2006-09-19 18:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848213, 395285, 42495, '<td valign="top">Colors are great and the tubes turns this from ho-hum into something interesting.  A couple of the colors seems to almost blend together - perahps a bit of black space like in the center two would help out.</td>', 'Colors are great and the tubes turns this from ho-hum into something interesting.  A couple of the colors seems to almost blend together - perahps a bit of black space like in the center two would help out.', '2006-09-19 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848217, 394190, 42495, '<td valign="top">Looks fine technically, and I like the colors.  Perhaps some cocktail making items would bring a bit more emphasis on the book.  Even as is, I really like it.</td>', 'Looks fine technically, and I like the colors.  Perhaps some cocktail making items would bring a bit more emphasis on the book.  Even as is, I really like it.', '2006-09-19 18:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848222, 395364, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Warning!</b> <i>Follow dosage carefully!  Age-Reduction formula could have amoebic consequences if taken in over-dose!"</i>  :)</td>', 'Warning! Follow dosage carefully!  Age-Reduction formula could have amoebic consequences if taken in over-dose!"  :)', '2006-09-19 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848232, 395357, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and the expression on the model is great.  In my opinion, what brings it down for me is the dirty test tubes and reflections on model.  Also, the test tube rack is tilted downward to the left.</td>', 'I like the idea here and the expression on the model is great.  In my opinion, what brings it down for me is the dirty test tubes and reflections on model.  Also, the test tube rack is tilted downward to the left.', '2006-09-19 18:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848236, 395011, 50034, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Looks like "foam"!  ;)</td>', 'Wow!  Looks like "foam"!  ;)', '2006-09-19 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848248, 395203, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF.  I like the monochromatic scheme.  Good composition - a little more empty space on top than I would have used... maybe not.  Very good overall!</td>', 'Nice use of DOF.  I like the monochromatic scheme.  Good composition - a little more empty space on top than I would have used... maybe not.  Very good overall!', '2006-09-19 18:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
