(2848367, 394678, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice ''play on photo'', hahah well done overall and I like the smoke it from the flame gives it a nice effect. However it seems a bit over processed in my opinion but that''s just me.</td>', 'Nice ''play on photo'', hahah well done overall and I like the smoke it from the flame gives it a nice effect. However it seems a bit over processed in my opinion but that''s just me.', '2006-09-19 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848372, 395406, 27847, '<td valign="top">The expression is just priceless and I love the eye expression it really adds character to the whole photography. Hope that wasn''t some permanent marker used as cover-up in this shot, hahah. Nicely done, keep it up.</td>', 'The expression is just priceless and I love the eye expression it really adds character to the whole photography. Hope that wasn''t some permanent marker used as cover-up in this shot, hahah. Nicely done, keep it up.', '2006-09-19 19:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848383, 395326, 27847, '<td valign="top">Love it and the colours are just brilliant in the shot, the water colours always produce great effects. Only thing I would have change in this show was maybe used a larger container and zoom in so that one couldn''t tell this was a glass. I think that would have greater overall impact in the photography. Still, nice work!</td>', 'Love it and the colours are just brilliant in the shot, the water colours always produce great effects. Only thing I would have change in this show was maybe used a larger container and zoom in so that one couldn''t tell this was a glass. I think that would have greater overall impact in the photography. Still, nice work!', '2006-09-19 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848397, 395146, 27847, '<td valign="top">Well, I think we are missing the salt in this BREAKFAST! Well place shot to add a little symmetry to it but I find the reflections from the surroundings a bit distracting, especially the overhead lights but that''s just me. I think maybe having a large white paper above and bouncing a flash off that would have produced a much more uniformed lighting situation. But keep up the good work.</td>', 'Well, I think we are missing the salt in this BREAKFAST! Well place shot to add a little symmetry to it but I find the reflections from the surroundings a bit distracting, especially the overhead lights but that''s just me. I think maybe having a large white paper above and bouncing a flash off that would have produced a much more uniformed lighting situation. But keep up the good work.', '2006-09-19 19:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848402, 395380, 27847, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this shot has great potential however I''m missing this whole since/drain part of the shot. That''s just me, however getting a better, lower angle on this and doing some side/back lighting would produce a great composition/shot. Once again, just my humble opinion.</td>', 'In my opinion this shot has great potential however I''m missing this whole since/drain part of the shot. That''s just me, however getting a better, lower angle on this and doing some side/back lighting would produce a great composition/shot. Once again, just my humble opinion.', '2006-09-19 19:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848407, 395378, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great example of chemistry, I get it totally. The over all shot could use a little external light/flash, either the processing has reduced the light on the Grooms face or this was a dark shot but that''s my only issue with it. Nice work.</td>', 'Great example of chemistry, I get it totally. The over all shot could use a little external light/flash, either the processing has reduced the light on the Grooms face or this was a dark shot but that''s my only issue with it. Nice work.', '2006-09-19 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2848410, 394576, 27847, '<td valign="top">That''s quite interesting very curious how you got the trails in the shot, don''t really see any smoke to show off the trails. Cool shot, not over exposed on at the light source... symmetric ... well done.</td>', 'That''s quite interesting very curious how you got the trails in the shot, don''t really see any smoke to show off the trails. Cool shot, not over exposed on at the light source... symmetric ... well done.', '2006-09-19 19:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
