(2852235, 395339, 53147, '<td valign="top">I had the same dilemma - I can''t NOT enter! Fortunately my score didnt have to count. Bring on the Free Study. I really look forward to seeing what you enter there.</td>', 'I had the same dilemma - I can''t NOT enter! Fortunately my score didnt have to count. Bring on the Free Study. I really look forward to seeing what you enter there.', '2006-09-20 20:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2852460, 395343, 57981, '<td valign="top">after my first comment, i''m now more impressed that you''ve explained how you got this.<br/> <br/>i really thought it was a mini plasma ball you can buy and use at home. but knowing it''s a steel ball and infra red pen is pretty amazing.<br/> <br/>you''ve definitely earned the ribbon with creativity and a great shot. <br/> <br/>110 second exposure is smart. you wouldn''t have used any external lighting ... it''s a great effect!!</td>', 'after my first comment, i''m now more impressed that you''ve explained how you got this. i really thought it was a mini plasma ball you can buy and use at home. but knowing it''s a steel ball and infra red pen is pretty amazing. you''ve definitely earned the ribbon with creativity and a great shot.  110 second exposure is smart. you wouldn''t have used any external lighting ... it''s a great effect!!', '2006-09-20 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2852637, 395343, 54446, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon.  This is a great photo that has nothing to do with chemistry, but you rec''d a pass from the voters. More power to you.  My image, which has a lot more real chemistry, was deemed to be DNMC.  The lesson here is to excel with great photography and no one will care whether you actually meet the challenge.  I think the voters in this challenge were exceptionally stupid.  But, I really do like your entry and I''m very happy it won a ribbon.  Just mad at all the low votes I rec''d.  (Not your fault!)</td>', 'Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon.  This is a great photo that has nothing to do with chemistry, but you rec''d a pass from the voters. More power to you.  My image, which has a lot more real chemistry, was deemed to be DNMC.  The lesson here is to excel with great photography and no one will care whether you actually meet the challenge.  I think the voters in this challenge were exceptionally stupid.  But, I really do like your entry and I''m very happy it won a ribbon.  Just mad at all the low votes I rec''d.  (Not your fault!)', '2006-09-20 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2852646, 395299, 54446, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your excellent photo!  It''s very good.  Has nothing to do with chemistry, but you rec''d a pass from the voters.  I''m mad because the voters punished me for my image, which contains a lot of real world chemistry.  Voters are really stupid.  (not your fault!)  This would be a good physics image.  Just to be clear, I really like your image and am happy it scored so well.  Just mad about the voters, in general.</td>', 'Congrats on your excellent photo!  It''s very good.  Has nothing to do with chemistry, but you rec''d a pass from the voters.  I''m mad because the voters punished me for my image, which contains a lot of real world chemistry.  Voters are really stupid.  (not your fault!)  This would be a good physics image.  Just to be clear, I really like your image and am happy it scored so well.  Just mad about the voters, in general.', '2006-09-20 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2852707, 393866, 10702, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, funny how many people told me not to touch my face with the gloves without seeing anything hazardous or even a hint to it.<br/> <br/>Well, I kind of put my hopes a little bit higher, at least 85% but I guess this just tells me to work harder and do better next time.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, funny how many people told me not to touch my face with the gloves without seeing anything hazardous or even a hint to it. Well, I kind of put my hopes a little bit higher, at least 85% but I guess this just tells me to work harder and do better next time.', '2006-09-20 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2852760, 395286, 10702, '<td valign="top">Ég spáði þessari nú hærra, bara tvær myndir sem ég gaf hærri einkunn, flottur árangur samt.</td>', 'Ég spáði þessari nú hærra, bara tvær myndir sem ég gaf hærri einkunn, flottur árangur samt.', '2006-09-20 23:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
