(2860346, 395107, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Cute. I didn''t even look at this challenge. Love the orange color of your bubbling mixture. And the tack sharpness of the bubbles as well. The green background is kind of glaring though. Maybe a lighter shade? Overall, a nice job. I probably would have given this a 7 or 8.</td>', 'Trading post...  Cute. I didn''t even look at this challenge. Love the orange color of your bubbling mixture. And the tack sharpness of the bubbles as well. The green background is kind of glaring though. Maybe a lighter shade? Overall, a nice job. I probably would have given this a 7 or 8.', '2006-09-24 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 0),
