(3304543, 395299, 39057, '<td valign="top">Has nothing to do with chemistry???? What the hell is this guy talking about? Great photo and meets challenge of Chemistry.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on your excellent photo!  It''s very good.  Has nothing to do with chemistry, but you rec''d a pass from the voters.  I''m mad because the voters punished me for my image, which contains a lot of real world chemistry.  Voters are really stupid.  (not your fault!)  This would be a good physics image.  Just to be clear, I really like your image and am happy it scored so well.  Just mad about the voters, in general. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Has nothing to do with chemistry???? What the hell is this guy talking about? Great photo and meets challenge of Chemistry. Originally posted by hahn23: Congrats on your excellent photo!  It''s very good.  Has nothing to do with chemistry, but you rec''d a pass from the voters.  I''m mad because the voters punished me for my image, which contains a lot of real world chemistry.  Voters are really stupid.  (not your fault!)  This would be a good physics image.  Just to be clear, I really like your image and am happy it scored so well.  Just mad about the voters, in general. ', '2007-01-30 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 0),
